# T_SCRE: a reservation and a use added from the loans and holds.  Ins
# chooses Reserve for item 23 typed, its holder, and its host typed as
# text, which F4 lists the items holding, the one chosen showing its
# maker and model; then Use with for item 23 again, the host typed as
# an ID (item 5) and looked up as the cursor leaves it, then typed as
# text, which clears the maker and model, then as digits that name no
# item, which the save looks for as text among the active items (none:
# item 27, whose serial number holds them, is disposed of), the form
# staying when that list is left; a third row, of two units, whose
# host typed as text is chosen when it is saved, is refused for want of
# units; the reservation released on the date typed.
S OPEN
K INS DOWN ENTER
T 23
K ENTER
S NEWRES
K TAB
T Club show
K TAB
T breadbin
K F4
S HOSTPICK
K ENTER
S HOSTSET
K CTRL-S
S RESERVED
K INS DOWN DOWN ENTER
T 23
K ENTER TAB TAB
T 5
K TAB
S USEFORM
K STAB CTRL-Y
T breadbin
K TAB
S HOSTTEXT
K STAB CTRL-Y
T 999
K CTRL-S
S HOST999
K ESC
S STAYS
K CTRL-Y
T 5
K CTRL-S
S USED
K INS DOWN DOWN ENTER
T 23
K ENTER BS
T 2
K TAB TAB
T breadbin
K CTRL-S
S SAVEPICK
K ENTER
S NOTENUF
K ESC
T Y
K HOME ALT-C R
S ASKREL
T 20261009
K ENTER
S RELEASED
K ESC
